{"id":"146689","name":"酱萝卜","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"","cover":"images/146689/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"萝卜","amount":"905克"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"勺"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白醋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"3勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"材料：萝卜","img":"images/146689/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将萝卜清洗一下。","img":"images/146689/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放在案板上切成片。","img":"images/146689/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"随后，将切好的萝卜放入搪瓷锅中。","img":"images/146689/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"接着，加入3勺盐。","img":"images/146689/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"用手调味抓匀,腌制30分钟。","img":"images/146689/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"然后，倒掉萝卜里腌制出来的辣水，加适量的生抽。","img":"images/146689/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加适量的白醋。","img":"images/146689/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入3勺白糖。","img":"images/146689/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"调味拌匀放入冰箱里腌制一个晚上更好吃。。。","img":"images/146689/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}